  "document": "Ghulam (film)\nGhulam (translation: \"Slave\") is a 1998 Indian action crime drama film directed by Vikram Bhatt starring Aamir Khan, Rani Mukerji and Deepak Tijori in the lead roles. The film was inspired by Elia Kazan's \"On the Waterfront\" (1954). It is the remake of Vishesh Films first production \"Kabzaa\" starring Sanjay Dutt. Ghulam did well at the box office and was declared as 'Hit'.. The song \"Aati Kya Khandala\", rendered by Aamir Khan and Alka Yagnik, was a chart-buster and trendsetter."
